{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01841","headline":"杂曲歌辞 潜别离 · 白居易","name":"杂曲歌辞 潜别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不得哭，潜别离，不得语，暗相思，两心之外无人知。\n深笼夜[锁]独栖鸟，利劒[春]断连理枝。\n河水虽浊有清日，乌头虽黑有白时。\n惟有潜离与暗别，彼此甘心无後期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}